WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.370
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.870
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.390
by ridding you...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.520
...of your other love?

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:48.110
At sunset,

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.650
when the children go home,

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:54.570
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.390
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.890
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:35.780
I'm Kurata Sana, age 11.

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:38.160
I'm a sixth grader,
who's also active as an entertainer.

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:40.950
Sagami Rei-kun. He's both
my chauffeur and my manager,

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:43.490
as well as my boyfriend and pimp!

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:46.460
My Aoki Laureate novelist Mama.
The chipmunk on her head is Maro-chan.

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:47.170
You're in the way.

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:48.830
How come?

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:53.500
And this is Hayama Akito, the former
monkey boss who has become a lonely wolf.

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:56.420
(Hen = "strange")

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:56.420
Hayama Akito's strange family.
They really are strange!

00:01:57.180 --> 00:02:00.430
This is your fault, Akito!
Everything is your fault!

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:02.100
You're the one who
killed Mother, after all!

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:03.430
You're the devil!

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:05.430
You're a devil child!

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:06.810
Hayama...

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:10.610
I'll do my best in this drama!

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:14.530
So you do your best, too! See ya!

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:23.580
"Chicken-and-Egg Dum-Dum,
Too Yucky to Eat"

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:28.830
♪ Hana, my flower, Hana, in dreams,
my eyes see you in dreams ♪

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:33.130
Huh? I've got a funny feeling
about what's going to happen...

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:36.460
Tsu-yo-shi-kun!

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:41.140
Hold up! Komawari Typhoon 100-Spin Stop!!

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:43.810
Why are you running away?

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:45.140
You could always show up normally.

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:46.350
Who am I, Jason?

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:48.270
"Pretty close..."

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:52.150
What I wanted to talk
to you about was Hayama.

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:54.480
Yesterday, when I went over to
his house, it was awfully strange.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:57.820
Something or other about Hayama's mother
dying because of her giving birth to him.

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:00.110
You must know something about it,
Tsuyoshi-kun, right?

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:08.500
Akito-kun's mother had always
had a weak constitution,

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:13.170
and because she overexerted
herself having Akito-kun, she died.

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:18.170
Akito-kun really believed himself to be
the devil up until about the second grade.

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:22.510
He said he burst out through
his mom's stomach, like in "Alien."

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:27.850
I told him that wasn't the case, but...

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:32.100
Remember, how earlier, how Akito-kun did
those overly nasty things to Mami-chan?

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:34.770
Hayama, the devil! The devil's boy!

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:38.360
I think it was because
she called him the devil.

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:44.320
So, Sana-chan, you should
understand that. Akito-kun isn't...

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:48.450
Strange...

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:50.790
They're strange, all right! That family!

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.250
--Being called "devil," "devil" at home
over and over for all this time,
--Sana-chan... S- Sana-chan...

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.790
--it's no wonder why Hayama
would be so perverse, is it!?
--Hold on... Sana-chan...

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:56.460
--What a stupid father
and daughter they are!
--Sana-chan...

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:57.800
Tsuyoshi-kun...!

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:00.470
I'm going to do my best in this drama!

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:04.140
♪ Now that I've made up my mind,
I'm going down the drama path! ♪

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:08.140
♪ Off I go, pressing forward,
Kurata Sana! ♪

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:08.810
Huh?

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.270
"Don't "huh?" us."

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:13.810
I'm off, Mama!

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:15.480
Ah, Sana-chan, come back soon!

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:17.150
Today, you start shooting
that drama, right?

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:18.480
That's right, Onda-san.

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:20.150
Go at it the best that you can.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:21.820
Huh? Mama, you're more
serious than usual.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.490
Yes, she is! Her manuscript
is three days late, after all.

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.490
Mama, you stick to it, as well!

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:28.490
--Onda! Onda!
--Sensei!

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:30.500
Good little kids,
have a shot of Spopotamin!

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.790
With your hand on your waist, and your
pinky extended, drink it all at once!

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:34.790
All right, I feel great!

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:36.790
For strong little kids and good
little kids, it's Supopotamin!

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:38.460
Would good little kids
normally drink that?

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:39.460
Want some, Rei-kun?

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:40.460
I'm okay.

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:42.130
Sana-chan, you're all worked up, huh?

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:43.470
Sure! I'm all aflutter!

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:45.840
Is that because of Hayama-kun?

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:51.810
I don't think so. It's unforgivable,
what that family has done.

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:55.440
Unforgivable. It's so
terribly unforgivable,

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.770
I just can't take not doing anything.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:06.820
♪ Unforgivable, and I can't take it! ♪

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:11.830
♪ I swore it to the setting sun, ♪

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:15.370
♪ My trembling heart answered me, ♪

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:17.500
--♪ Sana would do her best in the drama. ♪
--You can't let a scene go on seriously

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:19.500
--♪ I'm gonna do something
about Hayama's home. ♪
--for more than a second, can you?

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:22.300
"Enter Kurumi Asako, the actress."

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:24.510
Good morning! I'm Kurata Sana!

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:26.180
Ah, Sana-chan, you're so cute!

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:28.850
I'm sorry I couldn't
be here for the meeting.

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:30.850
That's okay, don't let it bother you.

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:31.430
Nice to meet you.

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:32.770
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:35.430
Hello, my student, Sana-chan!

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:37.770
Ah! Zenjiro-sensei! Good morning!

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:40.770
Good luck, Sana-chan! It's so nice
that you got such a good role.

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:44.780
Zenjiro-sensei, thank you! You came all
the way here just to support me, right?

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:46.110
What are you tawlking about?

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:48.110
--It toins out that I'll be
appearing in this drawma, too.
--I'm so, so, so, so,

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:50.450
--I'm playing the policeman.
I even have a line.
--super-happy!

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.790
--"Welcome." Yow-ow-ow,
what are you doing?
--Thank you! Thank you! Thank you!

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:54.620
--Are you listening to me Sana-chan?
--I'll do my best! Zenjiro-sensei,

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:56.790
--"Welcome." It's right here in the script.
--be sure to watch the broadcast!

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:59.790
--Hello? Hello? Hello?
--Say, Rei-kun, I wonder if the lead,
Kurumi Asako-san, is here yet.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:02.130
--Sana-chan?
--I'm looking awfully
forward to meeting her!

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:05.130
Are you going to say hello?
You really should, okay? I'm so excited!

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:08.470
After all, I love Kurumi-san!
Her acting is so natural.

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:11.390
You know? So when I heard that my sister
was going to be played by Kurumi-san,

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:12.470
I was so happy!

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:15.020
Shua! When I found out I was going to
play the policeman, and appear togeth-uh

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:16.480
--with you, Sana-chan...
--Ah, I'm about to meet her!

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:18.810
--Now, listen, Sana-chan, listen...
--I'm so thrilled and excited!

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:22.820
--Huh? Rei-kun? Where did you go?
--"Welcome." "Welcome."

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:25.530
I wonder if he went to the bathroom.
He could have at least said something.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:26.150
That's strange.

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:27.150
Sana-chan?

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:28.650
Sana-chan, right?

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:35.830
It's Kurumi Asako-san! Kurumi,
in person! Whoa, how pretty!

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:41.130
U- um... K- Kurata Sana. It's nice to--
to have the occasion to meet you.

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:45.090
--I watch you all the time on
"Zenjiro--san's Child's Toy."
--Really? Yahoo!

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:47.760
I also love your mother's novels.

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:48.760
It's nice to meet you.

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:50.130
Yes, that goes for me, too!

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:52.430
Wow, what an openhearted person!
That's terrific!

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:54.470
Kurumi-san, do you have a moment?

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:55.470
Yes...

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:56.680
--I'll see you later, Sana-chan.
--What should I be doing?

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:58.770
--Let's make this drama a good one.
--Zenjiro-san, you only have the one line,
so if you please,

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:00.810
--Right! I'll do my best!
--just go someplace
and drink some tea or something.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:01.810
Sana-chan, good morning!

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:03.110
Ah, Suji-san! Good morning!

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:04.820
Shall we get your face made up?

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:05.820
Come to the makeup room.

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:09.610
Let's see, where's Rei-kun?
Still in the bathroom? Oh well...

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:12.700
What is he doing?

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:16.490
Sana-chan is absent today.

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:18.790
Well, I heard they're
shooting her drama.

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:21.170
It's boring without Sana-chan around.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:23.130
Say, what kind of drama is it?

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:26.090
She didn't say what kind of drama it was,

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:30.470
but Sana-chan was adamant about showing it
to everyone in Akito-kun's family.

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:32.760
That girl is a complete busybody.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:34.430
Akito-kun!

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:37.720
How come that's the only way
you can think of her!?

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:41.100
Sana-chan is working
as hard as she can! I'm...

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:42.690
I'm getting angry!

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:50.280
I really can't think of her as being
anything else. I can't help it, can I?

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:56.240
I myself hate the way I am.

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:05.920
"Scene 11, this is a take!"

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:11.470
Sissy, do you have a minute?

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:14.140
What is it?

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:17.470
--You know what?
--Lunch money?

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:20.270
Are you going to an amusement
park with your friends?

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:23.810
Some new clothes? A bag?
What do you want?

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:26.150
How much do you want!?

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:29.480
Sissy... That's not it. I just...

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.860
Here, take it! As much as you want!

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:45.670
Why is this!? All the other kids my age
are all off at college or someplace,

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.420
enjoying themselves!

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:49.420
Sissy...

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:52.970
Mika, did you know that the reason
Mom's health got ruined

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:54.090
and she had to go to the hospital...

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:56.430
...was because she overexerted
herself giving birth to you?

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:59.600
And ever since then, I've done nothing
but work hard, taking care of you.

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:03.980
And all I ever wanted was
to just he happy, too!

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:06.440
I've had enough!

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:09.690
You demon child! If only
you had never been born...!

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:22.910
I'm sorry... I...

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:26.460
Mika!

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:27.790
Mika...

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:36.430
A birthday... present...? For me?

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:42.140
Cut! Okay!

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:50.110
Sana-chan, good! That was very
nice crying, and everything!

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:51.770
We train ourselves to cry
in Gekidan Komawari.

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:53.780
Care to use some of my tissue?

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:55.110
Zenjiro-san, you're on!

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:56.780
I'll be right there.

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:59.120
Sana-chan, that's enough.
You'll make your eyes puffy.

00:09:59.120 --> 00:09:59.780
Uh-huh.

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:01.120
H- huh...?

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:04.450
Huh? Have you overdone it?
Here's a towel.

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:05.450
Right...

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:09.130
You demon child!
I wish you had never been born!

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:11.750
It hurts to be told that,
even when we're acting.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:15.340
And he was raised being told
that kind of thing for real...

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:21.390
"Hmm?"

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:26.140
What are you doing, Rei-kun?

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:28.140
Are you on a shooting break?

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:30.690
Well then, let's hurry! There's a
magazine reporter waiting for us.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:35.400
For some reason, Rei-kun has been acting
suspiciously for the last little while.

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:37.400
You're probably wondering
what's going on, right?

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:39.410
Well, that will be covered
at length in the next episode.

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:43.080
Hi! Kurata Sana, age 11.
I'm with Gekidan Komawari.

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:46.000
My favorite food is
freshly-made corn flake paste.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:48.410
My favorite expression is
"Boo on being slapdash."

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:52.040
Uh, yeah, so Sana-chan, this will be
your first appearance in a drama.

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.420
I'd like to hear about the relish
you're undertaking this with.

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:58.420
My relish? My relish, right?
Not rubbish? Yes, relish!

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:00.300
There's someone I want to
be able to show this to!

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:01.430
They're just like those
who are in the drama!

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:04.100
Their family is the same! There's a
sister and a younger brother, though,

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:07.220
while I play a younger sister, but even
with that difference, it's still okay!

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:11.770
Hayama's father!

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:12.770
Hold it!

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.400
Hold it!

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:20.450
Good afternoon.

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:22.450
Hmm? Aren't you Akito's...

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:24.450
His classmate, Kurata Sana.

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:27.040
Ah. You're the nice girl

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:29.750
who has been getting along so well
with Akito at school then, huh?

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:34.460
You don't know a thing, do you?
You dimwitted, stupid father...

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:35.790
D- dimwitted...?

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:37.800
Like daughter, like father!

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:40.130
Because you act the way you do,
he suffers so much stress, it's terrible!

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:41.720
He was the boss monkey
toward Mitsuya-sensei,

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:43.800
and then he became the lonely wolf!

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:46.810
I'm butting in because even though
concern doesn't grow on trees, apples do!

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:49.520
If I was in a family where I was raised,
being called "devil, devil,"

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:51.810
I'd probably turn into
a real devil myself!

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:53.150
Devil...?

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:55.400
Are you still playing dumb!?

00:11:56.480 --> 00:12:00.150
Whoops, I'm still in the middle
of that interview. In any case...

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:03.820
Next week, on Friday night at 8 o'clock,
please watch the drama on channel 108.

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:05.820
All three of you should
watch it together!

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:08.830
If you don't, I'll come and wring your
necks for salad dressing. All right? Bye!

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:11.160
Sorry, Rei-kun!

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:15.080
President, who in the world was
that little fireball of a girl?

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:35.480
All right!

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:38.480
The interview went okay,
and I made my declaration of war!

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:41.150
Now, I'm going to do my best with
the afternoon filming, Rei-kun...!

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:43.820
Huh? He's gone again? Hey, Rei-kun!

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:47.160
Did you get caught behind here?
Of course you didn't...

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:52.160
For some reason, Rei-kun is
beyond my comprehension today.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:56.790
Which means... yes, yes, yes,
times like this call for Mama's trusty...

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:58.790
...personality assessment notebook!

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:02.170
Let's see... Favorite food,
toast with nothing on it;

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:04.840
Favorite color, mmm...
I'm sure it was sea cucumber-color...

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:07.800
So how about it? Oh, here
it comes, here it comes...

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:11.390
What's this? "You are the type that acts
as though you've abandoned your past,

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:13.520
but in reality,
you're still hung up about it."

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:14.520
What's this, now?

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:15.520
Sana-chan...

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:16.520
Kurumi-san!

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:18.190
What are you doing here?

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:19.480
Ah, actually...

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:23.150
Listen, Sana-chan, did your
manager not come with you today?

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:25.360
Huh? No, he's here,
but for some reason,

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:28.200
he's been disappearing all of a sudden.
He's acting very strange today.

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:30.490
Uh, did you need something with Rei-kun?

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:32.870
There isn't anything I need, exactly...

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:35.460
If you like, I can call him
on my Burutcha.

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:37.460
Kurumi-san!

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:40.130
And Sana-chan, too,
could you please report to makeup?

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:41.590
Right!

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:45.420
"And, while that was going on..."

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:54.140
Listen, would you choose a day for
parent-teacher conference already?

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:56.730
My teacher asked me about it again today.

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.480
Where's Akito?

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:01.900
Well, he's probably gone
to bed by now, hasn't he?

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:07.990
If I was in a family where I was raised,
being called "devil, devil,"

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:10.320
I'd probably turn into
a real devil myself!

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:12.580
Natsumi...

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:17.290
Never mind.

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:30.470
I'll do my best in this drama!
So you do your best, too!

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:36.480
"Shooting on the drama continues."

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:57.790
So, they finished up
all the shooting today?

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:01.790
Right, right. I cried...
I laughed... I got angry...

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:04.800
and used up all of the techniques
I learned at Komawari.

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:07.300
Ah, except that playing gateball
didn't come up.

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:11.800
So? You're going to show this
to Hayama and his family, right?

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:14.260
Mm-hmm! This drama is just like
what's going on at Hayama's house.

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:16.140
Like two peas in a pod!

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:17.770
The drama's happy end
will be contagious,

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:20.810
and Hayama's family will
unwittingly have a happy end, too!

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:23.810
I do hope it will be contagious
for Hayama's whole family.

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:25.820
It'll be contagious! Absolutely!

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:28.820
Once all three watch it together,
it's a sure thing!

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:30.820
♪ Come quickly, day of broadcast! ♪

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:32.820
♪ Everyone will be happy, happy-py! ♪

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:35.120
♪ All three in the family,
watch it together, ♪

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:36.790
♪ Take my word, there's no mistake. ♪

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:38.790
♪ Once you see it, you'll be happy-py! ♪

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:41.120
♪ Even outside of the drama, happy-py! ♪

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:44.130
♪ Oh! It's a rose-colored world! ♪

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:46.130
♪ The family will get along! ♪

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:48.130
--♪ Just watch the drama! ♪
--This week's Sana-chan

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:49.130
♪ You better not miss it! ♪

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:50.630
"It's here! The day of the broadcast."

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:57.810
Fight time has arrived! Hayama Family,
this is the last time I'm going to ask you!

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:00.140
Brace yourselves!

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:02.020
Hey, who was that! That was dirty!

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:07.480
Huh? Sana-chan?

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:10.150
Good afternoon.
Rather, good evening, I suppose.

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:11.490
What's this, all of a sudden?

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:13.490
I just came to remind
you about my drama.

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:15.160
Drama? What drama?

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:17.160
You haven't heard?

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:19.500
Is Hayama-- I mean, Akito-kun here?

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:23.330
Uh, he just barely left to go eat dinner.

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:26.170
Then, what about Mr. Hayama?

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:30.920
My father? He's at work today, and I
don't think he will be back until late.

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:35.760
And after I told him that much
that you should watch it together!

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:36.760
Sana-chan...

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:40.100
At this rate I'm going to lose to
the Hayama family without a fight...

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:41.770
The garbage can...?

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:44.100
Father? What's going on?
You're early, huh?

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:44.770
Uh-huh.

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:46.440
Mr. Hayama?

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:48.110
Sana-chan...

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:51.150
It's Dad! It's Dad!
It's Dad! Here, this way.

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:53.450
Now I've gotten the dum-dum
father-and-daughter together.

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:54.450
Dum-dum?

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:57.820
Yep. You guys are dum-dums.
What are you two doing,

00:16:57.820 --> 00:16:59.450
sending a grade-schooler out
to eat dinner by himself? Eh!?

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:01.080
It's because your household
is the way it is

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:02.450
that he has become
so frantically twisted,

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:04.790
and in order to relieve his stress,
he has to vent it at school!

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:07.790
He torments the teachers,
and bullies others, and stuff.

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:10.300
You call others devil this,
and devil that,

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:12.460
but what about yourselves?
You dummy father-and-daughter...

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:14.800
I duh thee "Chicken-and-egg dum-dums!"

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:16.470
What good does naming them do you?

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:19.470
Oh, no! Where is Hayama!? I'll go look!

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:22.140
Hey, Hayama!

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:24.140
Um, please watch the drama, okay?

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:26.560
Hayama! Come on, where are you!?

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:36.450
What are you running away for?
It's me! It's me!

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:38.160
That's why I'm running away.

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:41.450
This is your supper? Is it enough?

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:42.740
Give it back.

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:44.790
That's right... Hayama!

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:47.250
Don't just sit around here eating
your food, go watch my drama!

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:48.460
If you don't hurry, it's going to start!

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:51.460
Come on, let's get you home and
in front if the TV. What time is it...?

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:55.840
It's already 8 o'clock!
Why aren't you watching my drama!?

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:57.630
After everything I said!
Why!? Why!? Why!? Why!?

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:02.810
Don't you like being
together with them?

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:06.440
Watching together with
the others at home?

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:10.440
I dunno. I've never watched
anything together with them.

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:17.110
Say, Hayama...

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:19.660
Do you miss not having
your mother around?

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:25.830
I dunno. I never experienced
having her around.

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:28.920
I see. Uh-huh, I guess not, huh?

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:32.460
Listen, why don't I pretend
like I'm your mother?

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:34.760
I'll play your mother.

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:36.420
What do you mean? Cut it out.

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:39.430
Now, now, just watch.

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:44.430
I'm your mother... your mother... your
mother... your mother... your mother...

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:49.440
A-chan...

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:53.440
My, my, shooting juice out your nose--
what a funny little boy you are, A-chan.

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:56.440
Dinner is ready. Go and wash your hands.

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:58.450
How am I supposed to go along with this?

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.820
Do what I tell you to do, A-chan.

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:03.370
Otherwise, there's that
picture of you stripped...

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:07.870
"The mother game keeps going on"

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:10.120
A-chan...

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:12.790
Now, you're going to lay your
head in Mama's lap. Hey, come on!

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:13.460
Later.

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:15.460
"Stripped!"

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:18.130
Do as your mother tells you!

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:20.090
All right, do whatever you want.

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:24.810
♪ Lie still, my little boy, ♪

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:28.480
♪ Sleepy boy, time to lie down, ♪

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:31.350
♪ Lie still, my sleepy boy... ♪

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:33.480
Mama,

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:35.610
why did you have me?

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:37.730
Mika...

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:42.740
Mama loves you, Mika. I've loved you
since before you were born. That's why...

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:50.120
...I worked so hard to give birth to you.
It made me happy to have you, Mika.

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:52.870
Father...

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:57.750
I've... I've... been awful
to Akito, quite truthfully.

00:19:57.750 --> 00:20:01.090
I always get so upset,
and I can't help myself...

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:05.100
So I take it out on Akito,
and call him a devil...

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:09.600
Natsumi... you're not the one at fault.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:18.020
A-chan, about your Mama...

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:23.780
I love you, A-chan, and that's
why I tried so hard to have you.

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:29.790
And so, for Mama's sake...

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:34.250
keep at it, and go on living,
okay, A-chan?

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:41.420
Hayama...?

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:42.760
Waugh! You're warm!

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:45.760
Whoa, did you catch a cold!? No wonder
you've been playing along so easily!

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:48.430
I haven't caught anything!
Leave me alone! I didn't catch any cold!

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:49.430
Ah, you see?

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:52.100
I'm in complete control of myself.

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:56.980
No you're not! You try to do too much
by yourself, and not depend on others.

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:59.440
You should turn to others, too...

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:00.530
Hayama...?

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:09.790
Hayama, it's going to be all right.

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:12.450
I'm going to take you home.

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:14.160
Stop... Let me go...

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:17.790
Mr. Hayama?

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:19.130
What's the matter?

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:23.550
Um, he seems to have a fever. I think
it might be between 60 and 75 degrees...

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:27.260
I'm fine...

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:37.310
Your eyes-- they aren't the eyes of
a grade-schooler, are they, Akito?

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:41.440
I'm sorry.

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:51.160
Sana-chan...

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:54.160
Your drama... was good.

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:56.460
Thanks. Bye now.

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:04.550
His father's back was so big,

00:22:04.550 --> 00:22:08.550
it made Hayama look small,
which was kind of funny.

00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:16.690
All right?!

00:22:18.230 --> 00:22:23.280
The truth is, I know... but why now,
after all this time...!?

00:22:25.900 --> 00:22:30.910
The truth is, I know... but why now,
after all this time...!?

00:22:31.240 --> 00:22:33.240
The truth is, I know...

00:22:33.240 --> 00:22:36.120
but why now, after all this time...!?

00:22:37.370 --> 00:22:38.580
Asako...

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:42.250
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:47.760
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:52.510
In dire straits,

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:56.100
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:59.980
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:05.070
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:11.110
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:13.280
...panic!!

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:19.120
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:21.830
he's there.

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:25.090
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.300 --> 00:23:27.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:30.220
...for two.

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:33.680
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:38.430
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:42.020
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:46.730
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:52.320
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.990
he's there,

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.160
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:03.250
...for two.
